From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 10:38:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Search and rescue: Rescue school's four missions and the
 on-duty career (winter update O5)

One SAR engine runs a case: a casualty with their own survival clock (core
warmth draining with the rider's night/storm/height cold, measured where they
are; x0.6 pillion, x0.25 in the toboggan, warmed by your stove, saved at any
warm place). Rescue school: search (expanding-square pattern, boot prints, a
dropped glove), a rider stranded on a steep slope, a winch-and-tow (reuses the
recovery code, then a 7 m tow rope to the yard), and a cold casualty in the new
rescue toboggan (akja hitch, issued with the licence). Rescue app: on-duty
toggle, dash callouts with 30 s to accept, storm and polar-night odds, the
Map's rescue layer with survival timers, and reputation that raises pay and
range. Career saves feed the Logbook's rescue counter. Scripts ?v=37.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
